      "at": "2026-11-16T07:53:40.045Z",
      "type": "agent_text",
      "text": "I didn't place an order. The store can't confirm that any dock under $150 runs two 4K 60 Hz displays from a USB-C port.\n\n- **Demo Dock Duo ($129, OAW-DOCK-04):** This is the only dock that might work. It has 2 video outputs and 90 W power delivery, and it passed the USB-C port check. The store hasn't listed how many 4K 60 Hz displays it supports (`max_displays_4k60`), so I can't confirm it fits.\n- **Demo Dock Duo Lite ($89, OAW-DOCK-03):** It doesn't work. It supports only one 4K 60 Hz display.\n- **Demo Dock Solo ($59) and Demo Dock Travel ($39):** These don't work either. Each supports only one 4K 60 Hz display.\n\nIf the store adds the missing spec for the Demo Dock Duo, I can check it again and get a quote. You could also relax the dual 4K 60 Hz requirement, and I'd quote one of the single-display docks. Which do you want to do?"
    }
